flowchart TD
    A[Task in progress] --> B{¿Resultado válido?}
    B -->|Sí| C[CompleteTask]
    C --> D[EvaluateNextTasks]
    D --> E[MoveForward]
    B -->|No| F[RegisterIncident]
    F --> G{¿Tiene BACKWARD?}
    G -->|Sí| H[ResetTargetTask]
    H --> I[RetryCounter + 1]
    I --> J{¿Superó reintentos?}
    J -->|No| K[ReturnToPreviousTask]
    K --> A
    J -->|Sí| L[CloseWithError]
    G -->|No| L
